  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_fx_glitch">
    <text>Interference</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_fx_glitch_desc">
    <text>The picture tears and breaks up during emissions and psy storms, in psy fields, in strong radiation, next to anomalies, and briefly when you are hit hard.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_fx_glitch_strength">
    <text>Interference strength</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_fx_glitch_strength_desc">
    <text>How hard the picture breaks up. A steady psy field only flickers it; it gets heavy once your psy health is nearly gone, in emissions and psy storms, and right next to anomalies.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_signal_lost">
    <text>Signal lost on death</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_signal_lost_desc">
    <text>When you die the feed glitches, cuts to black and shows SIGNAL LOST with the last timestamp. While it is on it is the only death screen: it replaces other death screen mods (Death Like Romeo), which come back when it is off or the camera has no power.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_night_mode">
    <text>Low-light mode</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_night_mode_desc">
    <text>An optional grainy, nearly black-and-white infrared look in the dark. No real Axon Body has infrared, so it is off by default and works the same on every camera. Auto: at night and underground.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_lens_rain">
    <text>Rain on the lens</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_lens_rain_desc">
    <text>The game's own visor rain drops (Dynamic Visor Drops in GAMMA) on the camera, with or without a mask, even with the game's rain droplets option off. Without a mask the game's intact visor glass is switched on too, which the drops need (a faint glass edge). The mask-wipe key wipes them.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_lens_dirt">
    <text>Blood on the lens</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_lens_dirt_desc">
    <text>Blood splatters the lens when someone is shot right in front of you, and clears over time.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_event_marker">
    <text>Event marker</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_event_marker_desc">
    <text>EVENT appears after the recording timer for a few seconds when you fire or take a big hit, like the event button on a real bodycam.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_gps_line">
    <text>GPS line</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_zone_bodycam_gps_line_desc">
    <text>Coordinates under the name in the overlay, updated as you move.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_lst_zbc_night_auto">
    <text>Auto (night, underground)</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_lst_zbc_night_always">
    <text>Always</text>
  </string>
  <string id="ui_mcm_lst_zbc_night_off">
